desc:
Our booster seat "Max" is suitable for children with a body weight of 15-36 kg - this corresponds to an age of approximately 3.5-12 years (Group 2+3). The booster fits on any common car seat and secures your child with the vehicle's 3-point safety belt. Contrary to the common use of polystyrene cores, PETEX booster seats have a core made of impact-resistant hard plastic and have been tested accordingly according to ECE R44/04. The padding is flame-retardant, as is the breathable fabric. For hygiene purposes, the seat cover is removable and can be washed.

HIGHEST SAFETY IN THE CAR FOR THE LITTLE ONES

